> 1e8+e1
  note: 2e1 is read as 2*e1 (a unit), not the number 20; write 20 or 2.0e1 for the number
100000000 + e1
> commutator 1e8+e1, 2e8+3e1
[a, b] = ab - ba = 2e+16 + 500000000 e1 - (2e+16 + 500000000 e1) = 0
  they commute
> associator 1e8+e1, e2, e3
[a, b, c] = (ab)c - a(bc) = -1 + 100000000 e1 - (-1 + 100000000 e1) = 0
  the product of these three is associative (in the octonions)
> 1e5+e1
  note: 2e1 is read as 2*e1 (a unit), not the number 20; write 20 or 2.0e1 for the number
e1 + e5
